WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:01.800
- All right, let's get to one last story.

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.030
I'm hoping we'll make you smile.

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.306
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:04.306 --> 00:00:06.960
(bouncy music)

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.910
So most people dread going to the dentist.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:12.888
It makes sense. It's not exactly
fun unless you get nitrous.

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:13.721
(crowd laughing)

00:00:13.721 --> 00:00:14.554
Just saying.

00:00:14.554 --> 00:00:16.680
Well, one North Carolina
Dental Hygienist is all about

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.383
making this experience less
distressing for people.

00:00:19.383 --> 00:00:22.530
When the patients show up
she greets them in costume,

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:23.502
which is awesome.

00:00:23.502 --> 00:00:24.630
- [Audience] Aw.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:28.050
- For decades now, Judy's put
people in her chair at ease

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:31.290
and we have her on the line
right now watching on WXLV.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.253
What's up, Judy?

00:00:33.131 --> 00:00:34.124
(audience cheering)

00:00:34.124 --> 00:00:35.745
- Hey Kelly.

00:00:35.745 --> 00:00:38.130
- I love you so much. I love what you do.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:40.770
So what made you start
doing this dressing up?

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:44.250
- Oh, back in the early
1990s, I had a patient

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:48.665
who gifted me with a leftover
New Year's Eve party hat.

00:00:48.665 --> 00:00:51.510
I wore that hat that whole day.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:55.200
I greeted my patients
with a "Happy New Year."

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.260
I couldn't believe the difference it made.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:00.570
They actually smiled!

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:02.781
Who smiles coming to the dentist?

00:01:02.781 --> 00:01:03.614
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:03.614 --> 00:01:04.504
(audience laughing)

00:01:04.504 --> 00:01:05.460
Anyway, since that time,

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.310
I have worn something
silly or fun every day

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:11.760
when I greet my patients and
bring them back to my room.

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.590
I usually take most of it off though

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:15.507
before I start cleaning their teeth.

00:01:15.507 --> 00:01:17.040
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:18.690
- 'Cause it would be
funny if they were under

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:19.920
and then all of a sudden they came out

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:21.852
and they're like (screams and laughs).

00:01:21.852 --> 00:01:23.771
It's funny video footage, just saying.

00:01:23.771 --> 00:01:27.120
Tell us about some of
your favorite costumes.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.980
- Well, just about anything

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:31.088
to make my patients feel comfortable,

00:01:31.088 --> 00:01:34.110
calm, cool, even laughing.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.992
I have a bunch of silly glasses.

00:01:35.992 --> 00:01:37.624
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:37.624 --> 00:01:40.350
I have funky hats.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.090
I even have the full costumes.

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:43.620
Like the one-eyed, one-horn,

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:46.359
flying-purple-people tooth cleaner.

00:01:46.359 --> 00:01:47.442
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:47.442 --> 00:01:49.200
Or the super flosser girl.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:52.170
Sometimes you do have to
be serious and that's okay.

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:55.020
But other times you can have fun and laugh

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.940
and joke with your patients.

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:59.390
And they even look forward
to coming to see me,

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:00.314
believe it or not.

00:02:00.314 --> 00:02:01.447
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:01.447 --> 00:02:02.410
(audience laughing)

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:04.380
So anyway, just remember brush twice,

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:06.475
floss and have fun every day.

00:02:06.475 --> 00:02:08.130
(audience clapping)

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:11.086
- Exactly, Judy. Oh my gosh, I love you.

00:02:11.086 --> 00:02:14.130
You're making me miss home
with that accent, I love it.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.368
Thank you so much, Judy.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:16.386
(Judy laughing)

00:02:16.386 --> 00:02:18.076
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:18.076 --> 00:02:20.010
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:21.210
And that's not all, Judy.

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:23.580
Our season-long partner,
Pilot Pen, makers of FriXion

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.650
the go-to erasable pen of
the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:28.020
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:30.562
and making people feel comfortable
and happy just like you.

00:02:30.562 --> 00:02:32.340
So they're gonna give you $1,000 dollars.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:33.671
How's that sound?

00:02:33.671 --> 00:02:34.909
(audience cheering)

00:02:34.909 --> 00:02:36.956
- That's great! That's
marvelous. Thank you.

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:40.530
- All right! Have a blessed
day, Judy. Thank you so much.

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:41.376
And thank you to all
of our guests this hour

00:02:41.376 --> 00:02:42.270
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:45.810
Jake Gyllenhaal, Matt Iseman,
Daveed Diggs and Ian Munsick.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.353
Y'all have a great day. If
it's not, try and change it.

